00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:00,453
This will not end well!

265
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:07,530
It's over!

266
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:09,287
There's no stopping him now!

267
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:29,746
I don't know what that deafening roar
was, but it didn't sound like Olene to me.

268
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:30,910
So scary.

269
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:35,382
Neither of them will be
happy when they see this.

270
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:37,430
We're finished.

271
00:20:37,513 --> 00:20:39,260
We can't make a second batch.

272
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:40,520
There's no time

273
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:53,640
You're right, we have a ton of Oshiroko
here, but it belongs to me alone.

274
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:57,000
I won't share a drop with you

275
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:01,660
Oh, I see now

276
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:08,497
Polina's still pretty scary, but
she's like a nice version of Big Mom,

277
00:21:08,580 --> 00:21:10,877
so I don't know if she can
stand up to Queen or not.

278
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:11,977
Wow, this is weird.

279
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:13,766
I'm almost worried about her.

280
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:19,680
So what I'm hearing is that
you've got Oshiruko, right?

281
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:21,720
Listen, woman.

282
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:26,660
I will fight you to the death before
I even let you look at my Oshiruko.

283
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:29,760
Now buzz off or die!

284
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:34,120
Karoo!

285
00:21:37,180 --> 00:21:38,580
Karoo!

286
00:21:46,660 --> 00:21:47,490
Uh...

287
00:21:48,660 --> 00:21:49,490
Whoa!

288
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:02,557
What the...

289
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:04,600
Listen, you...

290
00:22:06,180 --> 00:22:09,320
I came for that soup, OK?

291
00:22:10,660 --> 00:22:13,680
And I will have it!

292
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:20,400
Olene!

293
00:22:22,560 --> 00:22:25,020
Let the queen know!

